### Phase 3: Inference Engine (Rust + PyO3)

#### [NEW] `onyx_inference/` Rust crate
- **`engine.rs`**: Wraps `llama-cpp-4` crate with CUDA feature flag
  - `InferenceEngine::new(model_path, n_gpu_layers, ctx_size)`
  - `InferenceEngine::infer(prompt, max_tokens)` → token stream
  - Supports streaming callbacks for real-time HUD updates
- **`model_pool.rs`**: Manages loaded GGUF models
  - Load/unload models based on agent demand
  - Memory tracking per model (feeds back into market)
- **`stream.rs`**: Async token streaming channel
  - `TokenStream` pushable to Python via PyO3
- **PyO3 bindings**: Expose `InferenceEngine` to Python/Cython

#### `Cargo.toml` dependencies:
```toml
[dependencies]
llama-cpp-4 = { version = "0.1", features = ["cuda"] }
pyo3 = { version = "0.22", features = ["extension-module"] }
tokio = { version = "1", features = ["rt-multi-thread"] }
```

