### Phase 4: Hardware Abstraction Layer (Rust)

#### [NEW] `onyx_hal/` Rust crate
- **`thermal.rs`**: Read Jetson thermal zones
  - Parse `/sys/devices/virtual/thermal/thermal_zone*/temp`
  - Expose `get_cpu_temp()`, `get_gpu_temp()`, `get_soc_temp()`
- **`power.rs`**: Read INA3221 power monitor
  - Parse `/sys/bus/i2c/drivers/ina3221/*/hwmon/*/`
  - Expose `get_power_draw_mw()`, `get_voltage_mv()`
- **`camera.rs`**: CSI camera capture (future - use OpenCV for now)
- PyO3 bindings for all HAL functions

