### Phase 6: Built-in Agents

#### [NEW] `agents/emotion_agent.py` (RT_HARD)
- Captures camera frame → runs emotion classifier
- Cannot be degraded or evicted (rigid constraint)
- Utility: 100 | Power: 5W | RAM: 1GB

#### [NEW] `agents/voice_agent.py` (RT_SOFT)
- Wake word detection → NLU → LLM inference → TTS
- Can be degraded but not evicted during active conversation
